# Dragonstalker, "protection from Dragons" (CR 702.16b, 702.16e, 702.16f): protection from a creature type. On turn 2 Bot2's Nova
# Hellkite (a red Dragon, 4/5, flying and haste) enters and its "deals 1 damage to target creature an opponent controls"
# may not target the Dragonstalker (a Dragon's ability): with the Memnite (the control) the only creature it can target, no
# target is asked for and the Memnite dies, the Dragonstalker unharmed (were both legal, Bot2 would be asked). On turn 3 the
# Dragonstalker attacks and the Hellkite, a flier that would otherwise block it, may not, though the colorless Ornithopter may
# (the control) and dies. On turn 6 the Hellkite attacks and the untapped Dragonstalker (3/3) blocks it: the Hellkite's 4 damage
# is prevented (the Dragonstalker would have died), while its own 3 is dealt to the Hellkite.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Memnite
Dragonstalker
Plains x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Nova Hellkite
Ornithopter
Island x19

